`bun test` exits 0 with 73 tests passing. Here's what was built:

**New files:**
- `src/ws/messages.ts` — all client/server message type definitions, `parseMessage`, `serializeMessage`
- `src/ws/connections.ts` — `Map<ServerWebSocket, ConnectionInfo>` with register/unregister/get helpers
- `src/ws/handler.ts` — `handleWsUpgrade` (auth via query params, token creation for players) + `createWsHandlers` (open/message/close with fog mask cache and 1s debounced saves)
- `test/ws/handler.test.ts` — 12 integration tests covering all specified scenarios

**Modified files:**
- `src/types.ts` — added `WsData` interface
- `src/index.ts` — wired `/ws` upgrade path and WebSocket handlers
- `test/helpers.ts` — added `startWsTestServer` / `WsTestServer`

Key design decisions:
- Auth happens at HTTP upgrade time via query params (synchronous DB checks → no async before `server.upgrade`)
- `ws.publish(topic, ...)` used throughout (excludes sender, which is correct for all cases)
- For `token:moved`, sender also gets `ws.send` so they receive their own move confirmation
- Fog mask cache is module-level (keyed by imageId); debounced save triggers 1s after last stroke
